Assignment 18: IAM Policy Testing and Validation
Task:
Create and test restrictive IAM policies with proper boundaries.
What to Do:
●    Create IAM user developer-test
●    Create custom policy that allows:
●    Read-only access to S3 buckets with tag "Team: Dev"
●    Launch EC2 instances only t2.micro/t3.micro
●    Create/delete only in specific VPC
●    No access to production resources
●    Use IAM Policy Simulator to test:
●    Can list S3 buckets
●    Cannot delete S3 objects
●    Can launch t2.micro instance
●    Cannot launch t2.large instance
●    Create SCP (Service Control Policy) for test OU:
●    Deny all regions except us-east-1 and eu-west-1
●    Deny deletion of CloudTrail
●    Test policy with Access Analyzer
●    Create permission boundary
●    Test assume role with session policies
Success Criteria:
●    Policies enforce correct restrictions
●    Policy Simulator confirms permissions
●    User cannot exceed boundaries
●    Access Analyzer shows no public access